  "content": "\n\n<p>Этот пакет ресурсов добавляет кастомное небо в пиксельном стиле. Основываясь на проекте <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/XSSheep?__cf_chl_jschl_tk__=0cd05e71855cf2e8f211c9be122b2d9798fb86ca-1594543114-0-AXuCk8wmp99Q2MLjHOpHpVxrxoPjK70-Nt948w1ABLQPhkDmAKDyldwSZU9wCbrjgULVlrXWpSufWdiIIykCD__10vLmD_-tfkNffpsZBLqAsrp_6-wFOm3KLRyZ-ecDVmcUpWtbt_VZfqtoO_T0soWb-8WLLYQFbdKE72LiDstvcnvhmJzpcJNVMF9aYhLmAhLJ52epgEza9J9KZ64uY--ykq8Jr5NQZ2hu_Jj1He7KHoDsHQuPBoNNEI3fVeF8XCO3rxYpfoKvOGMznGDB0r6iNOgUFhTuLAOehjIYYTNH\" rel=\"nofollow\">XSSheep </a>'s Pixel Perfection, теперь его можно использовать в современных версиях игры. Требуется <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a></strong>, данный пакет не работает самостоятельно.</p>\n<p>Рекомендуется использовать <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frounded-sun-moon-souralien\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rounded Sun &amp; Moon</a></p>\n<p>Все заслуги принадлежат <strong><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/XSSheep?__cf_chl_jschl_tk__=0cd05e71855cf2e8f211c9be122b2d9798fb86ca-1594543114-0-AXuCk8wmp99Q2MLjHOpHpVxrxoPjK70-Nt948w1ABLQPhkDmAKDyldwSZU9wCbrjgULVlrXWpSufWdiIIykCD__10vLmD_-tfkNffpsZBLqAsrp_6-wFOm3KLRyZ-ecDVmcUpWtbt_VZfqtoO_T0soWb-8WLLYQFbdKE72LiDstvcnvhmJzpcJNVMF9aYhLmAhLJ52epgEza9J9KZ64uY--ykq8Jr5NQZ2hu_Jj1He7KHoDsHQuPBoNNEI3fVeF8XCO3rxYpfoKvOGMznGDB0r6iNOgUFhTuLAOehjIYYTNH\" rel=\"nofollow\">XSSheep </a></strong>.</p>\n<h1>ЗАВИСИМОСТИ</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a> (ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНО)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frounded-sun-moon-souralien\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rounded Sun &amp; Moon</a> (РЕКОМЕНДУЕТСЯ)</li>\n</ul>\n<h1><strong>МОИ ДРУГИЕ ПАКЕТЫ PP</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpixel-perfection-fidelity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection Fidelity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpixelperfectionxfarmersdelight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x FARMER'S DELIGHT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fpixel-perfection-x-the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x THE TWILIGHT FOREST</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fpixel-perfection-x-ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x AD ASTRA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpixel-perfection-x-dehydration\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x DEHYDRATION</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpixel-perfection-x-controlify\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x CONTROLIFY</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fppl-alternative-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Alternative GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fppl-compatibility-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Compat Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fppl-hodgepodge\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Hodgepodge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fppl-better-grass\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Better Grass</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fppl-custom-theme-for-jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Custom Theme for Jade</a></li>\n</ul>",
